{
  "title": "Exotic Crisp Thai Porcini Pad Thai",
  "description": "A quick-fix Thai dish featuring porcini mushrooms and a tagine-cooked twist, this exotic pad thai is low in calories and packed with flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Thai",
  "diet": [
    "low-calorie",
